# WN22-SO-000210: Windows Server 2022 must not allow anonymous SID/Name translation.
# Source: Windows Server 2022 STIG r8
# Severity: high
# Generated from 01-extract/output/windows-server-2022-stig-r8-controls.json

META
    esp_id `win2022-wn22-so-000210-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `windows`
    criticality `critical`

    title `Windows Server 2022 must not allow anonymous SID/Name translation.`
    description `Allowing anonymous SID/Name translation can provide sensitive information for accessing a system. Only authorized users must be able to perform such translations.`
    author `scanset-security`
    tags `windows,server-2022,stig,high,security-option,security-policy,ksi-cmt-lmc,ksi-cmt-rmv,ksi-mla-evc,ksi-svc-acm`

    control_mapping `KSI:KSI-CMT-LMC,KSI:KSI-CMT-RMV,KSI:KSI-MLA-EVC,KSI:KSI-SVC-ACM,NIST-800-53:CM-6`
    control_objective `KSI-CMT-LMC,KSI-CMT-RMV,KSI-MLA-EVC,KSI-SVC-ACM`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Windows:server-2022:endpoint`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `1`
    recommendation `Configure the policy value for Computer Configuration >> Windows Settings >> Security Settings >> Local Policies >> Security Options >> Network access: Allow anonymous SID/Name translation to "Disabled".`

    component_id `comp-windows-security-policy`

    impl_KSI_CMT_LMC `Windows Server implements KSI-CMT-LMC by enforcing LSAAnonymousNameLookup per the STIG (Anonymous SID/Name translation must be disabled (LSAAnonymousNameLookup = 0).). The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`
    impl_KSI_CMT_RMV `Windows Server implements KSI-CMT-RMV by enforcing LSAAnonymousNameLookup per the STIG (Anonymous SID/Name translation must be disabled (LSAAnonymousNameLookup = 0).). The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`
    impl_KSI_MLA_EVC `Windows Server implements KSI-MLA-EVC by enforcing LSAAnonymousNameLookup per the STIG (Anonymous SID/Name translation must be disabled (LSAAnonymousNameLookup = 0).). The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`
    impl_KSI_SVC_ACM `Windows Server implements KSI-SVC-ACM by enforcing LSAAnonymousNameLookup per the STIG (Anonymous SID/Name translation must be disabled (LSAAnonymousNameLookup = 0).). The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`
    impl_CM_6 `Windows Server implements CM-6 by enforcing LSAAnonymousNameLookup per the STIG (Anonymous SID/Name translation must be disabled (LSAAnonymousNameLookup = 0).). The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target
        policy_name `LSAAnonymousNameLookup`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE compliant
        exists boolean = true
        value_int int = 0
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN windows_security_policy
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF compliant
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
